{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121476","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121476/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121476/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121476/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121476","id":4906103502,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJG0yzg","number":121476,"title":"C# GD0303: The parent symbol of a type argument that must be Variant compatible was not handled","user":{"login":"neclor","id":81529592,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNTI5NTky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81529592?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor","html_url":"https://github.com/neclor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-07-16T21:23:32Z","updated_at":"2026-08-11T19:20:37Z","closed_at":"2026-08-11T19:12:19Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Godot 4.7.0\n- .NET 9\n- C# 14\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10\n\n### Issue description\n\n`MustBeVariantAnalyzer` reports GD0303 when a C# 14 extension member (declared in\nan `extension` block) is called with explicit type arguments.\n\nThe code is plain C# - no Godot types, and compiles fine in\na non-Godot project.\n\n`GD0303: The parent symbol 'FooExtensions.extension<IntProvider, int>(IntProvider).GetNumber()' of a type argument that must be Variant compatible was not handled`\n\nDocs say GD0303 is an engine bug and should be reported:\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.7/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/diagnostics/GD0303.html\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nMinimal code to reproduce:\n\n```csharp\nusing System;\nusing System.Numerics;\n\t\t\t\t\t\npublic interface IHaveNumber<TNumber> where TNumber : INumber<TNumber> {\n\tstatic virtual TNumber GetNumber() => TNumber.Zero;\n}\n\npublic static class FooExtensions {\n\textension<T, TNumber>(T) where T : IHaveNumber<TNumber> where TNumber : INumber<TNumber> {\n\t\tpublic static TNumber GetNumber() => T.GetNumber();\n\t}\n}\n\npublic class IntProvider : IHaveNumber<int> { }\n\npublic static class Program {\n\tpublic static void Main() {\n\t\tint num = IntProvider.GetNumber<IntProvider, int>();\n\t\tConsole.WriteLine(num);\n\t}\n}\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n-","closed_by":{"login":"paulloz","id":437025,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNzAyNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/437025?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz","html_url":"https://github.com/paulloz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121476/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121476/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}